<title>JAPAN: Daikin Industries - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daikin Industries - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		171.99		vs	  168.25</p>
<p> Operating	    9.54		vs	    8.59</p>
<p> Current		8.97		vs	    7.66</p>
<p> Net		    4.78		vs	    4.08</p>
<p> EPS		   18.12 yen	  vs	   15.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    264 million	  vs	 264 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daikin Industries Ltd is a major manufacturer of commercial airconditioners.</p>
